ers/blueskythlikesclouds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in: 4.6 release 26 January 2026 (Godot_v4.6-stable_mono_win64)\n\n### System information\n\nRendering Method: Forward+ | Windows 10 Pro (22H2) | GPU: RTX 5070 Ti | CPU: 9800X3D\n\n### Issue description\n\nScreen Space Reflections exhibit visible vertical streaking / banding artifacts on smooth reflective surfaces.\n\nThe artifacts are most noticeable when the reflective object is not in contact with the ground (e.g. floating). In this situation, vertical streaks extend from the reflection toward the actual object, forming visible screen-space aligned bands between the reflected and real geometry.\n\n<img width=\"1919\" height=\"1039\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6d435ce5-ad03-48a0-adec-a0fa6888dc3d\" />\n\n<img width=\"1919\" height=\"1039\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b0452713-eb06-4667-b11f-edda9129a204\" />\n\n### Additional notes\n- Increasing Max Steps in SSR settings doesn't help fixing the issue\n- Disabling the SSR Half Size (enabled by default) doesn't help fixing the issue\n- The issue persists with different roughness values\n- The issue persists with Temporal AA on/off \n- A minimal reproduction project is attached\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Enable Screen Space Reflections in the environment\n2. View the reflective surface when an object is floating above the ground.\n3. Observe vertical streaking artifacts in the reflection\n\nAlternatively open the attached minimal reproduction project.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[ssr-test-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25152164/ssr-test-mrp.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116008/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116008/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}